<title>SOUTH KOREA: Secondary unit turnarounds for S. Korean refiners.</title>
<headline>Secondary unit turnarounds for S. Korean refiners.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hyundai Oil Refinery Co, a unit of South Korea's Hyundai Group, plans to shut down a number of secondary units during the maintenance of its crude distillation units (CDU) later this year, officials said on Friday.</p>
<p>The following shows the secondary unit turnarounds of Hyundai, plus some other South Korean refineries;</p>
<p>Unit			    Capacity    Shutdown Period</p>
<p>HANWHA ENERGY CO</p>
<p>CDU 1			  75,000 bpd     Sep 21-Oct 23</p>
<p>mid-dist desulphuriser    7,500 bpd     Sep 21-Oct 23</p>
<p>CDU 2			 200,000 bpd     May 23-Jun 25</p>
<p>mid-dist desulphuriser   40,000 bpd     May 23-Jun 25</p>
<p>HYUNDAI OIL REFINERY CO  HYGR.CN</p>
<p>CDU 1			 110,000 bpd     Aug 18-Sep 10</p>
<p>vacuum distillation unit 42,000 bpd</p>
<p>naphtha desulphuriser    24,000 bpd</p>
<p>Gas oil desulphuriser    22,000 bpd</p>
<p>Heavy oil hydrocracker   34,000 bpd</p>
<p>CDU 2			 200,000 bpd     May 10-Jun 8</p>
<p>Kero desulphuriser	 24,000 bpd</p>
<p>Naphtha desulphuriser    20,000 bpd</p>
<p>Gas oil desulphuriser    32,000 bpd</p>
<p>SSANGYONG OIL REFINING CO</p>
<p>CDU 1			  93,000 bpd     Jun 4-22</p>
<p>Mid-dist desulphuriser   21,000 bpd</p>
<p>CDU 2			 150,000 bdp     May 6-Jun 1</p>
<p>Hydro desulphuriser	47,000 bpd</p>
<p>CDU 3			 200,000 bpd     Aug 3-23</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (+822 727 5643)</p>
</text>
